---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { SITE } from "../lib/constants";

const updated = "30 October 2026";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="FollowExam privacy policy — kaunsa data collect hota hai, kaise use hota hai, aur aapke rights kya hain."
>
  <section class="section-tight" style="padding-top:34px">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="breadcrumb" style="padding:0 0 14px">
        <a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span>Privacy</span>
      </div>

      <article class="prose">
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="small muted">Last updated: {updated}</p>

        <p>
          FollowExam aapki privacy ko respect karta hai. Ye policy batati hai ki hum kaunsa data collect karte hain,
          kyun collect karte hain, aur aap us data ko kaise control kar sakte hain.
        </p>

        <h2>1. Hum kaunsa data collect karte hain</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Email address aur naam</strong> — jab aap daily alerts ke liye subscribe karte hain.</li>
          <li><strong>Account data</strong> — agar aap login karte hain (email, display name, saved jobs).</li>
          <li><strong>Technical data</strong> — browser type, device type, approximate location aur page visits (analytics ke through).</li>
          <li><strong>Messages</strong> — jo aap contact form ya email ke through bhejte hain.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>2. Data kaise use hota hai</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Daily exam update emails bhejne ke liye.</li>
          <li>Saved jobs aur personalized experience dene ke liye.</li>
          <li>Site ki speed, content aur usability improve karne ke liye.</li>
          <li>Spam, abuse aur security issues rokne ke liye.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>3. Data kis ke saath share hota hai</h2>
        <p>
          Hum aapka personal data bechte nahi hain. Data sirf un service providers ke saath share hota hai jo site
          chalane ke liye zaroori hain — jaise Firebase (Google), email delivery service aur hosting provider. Ye
          providers apne privacy terms ke under data handle karte hain.
        </p>

        <h2>4. Cookies aur local storage</h2>
        <p>
          Site login session, saved-jobs preferences aur basic analytics ke liye cookies/local storage use karti hai.
          Aap browser settings se cookies block kar sakte hain, lekin kuch features phir kaam nahi karenge.
        </p>

        <h2>5. Email alerts aur unsubscribe</h2>
        <p>
          Har alert email me unsubscribe ka option hota hai. Aap kabhi bhi email reply karke ya apne account settings
          se alerts band kar sakte hain. Unsubscribe request ke baad hum aapko marketing email nahi bhejte.
        </p>

        <h2>6. Data retention</h2>
        <p>
          Subscriber data tab tak rakha jata hai jab tak aap unsubscribe nahi karte. Account data account delete
          request tak rakha jata hai. Contact messages reasonable time tak rakhe jate hain, phir delete kar diye jate
          hain.
        </p>

        <h2>7. Bachchon ki privacy</h2>
        <p>
          FollowExam 13 saal se kam umar ke bachchon se jaan-boojh kar personal data collect nahi karta. Agar aapko
          lagta hai ki kisi minor ka data aa gaya hai, to humein contact karein.
        </p>

        <h2>8. Aapke rights</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Apna data dekhne ki request.</li>
          <li>Data correction ki request.</li>
          <li>Data deletion ki request.</li>
          <li>Alerts unsubscribe karne ka right.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          In requests ke liye <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a> par likhein.
        </p>

        <h2>9. Third-party links</h2>
        <p>
          Hamare posts me official government websites ke links hote hain. Un websites ki privacy policies alag hain —
          unhe padhna aapki zimmedari hai. FollowExam un sites ke content ya data practices ke liye responsible nahi
          hai.
        </p>

        <h2>10. Policy updates</h2>
        <p>
          Ye policy kabhi kabhi update ho sakti hai. Bade changes hone par hum site par notice denge. Latest version
          hamesha is page par milega.
        </p>

        <h2>11. Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Privacy se judi kisi bhi sawaal ke liye: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
